               		Kick-Boxing Instructions:

Training : This will increase your strength everytime you win a fight, what 
this is need for is to build up for the title. This feature is made that it is 
not hard to beat the computer but in the boxing matches it will be tougher.

Matches : This is where you fight 20 boxers then get to fight the champ, if you
are having trouble fighting the computer in the match, train more and build up 
your strength. After you beat all 20 players you will become champ, then other
players must fight you, also notice when you are champ you can build up your 
strength by training, therefor making it harder for another user to beat you.

Multi-User Fighting : If there is another user online (If the bbs is Multi
user) you may fight this user. Hit three at the main command menu and it will
load this module. From there its not hard to do, This does not save onto your
boxing record.

Strength : Your strength is very important to raise. The players in the matchs
are difficult as you go up. If you keep losing the match train more to raise
your strength.

Power Kicks : You are allowed two power kicks, this well to 2 times the damage
of any kick in a match. To obtain these kicks you must train.

Also other quick note: If you keep losing, don't give up, the game is not 
impossible.

